    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 167,
        "text": "Welcome to the Green Street Community Garden meeting. I'm David, the coordinator. Our budget for next season is 500 pounds, and we need to prioritise carefully.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f0563ec8daae0e2bd2a6e6ec8af58d3b0531168a52069542dd6267f530e8363d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 174,
        "sourceEnd": 300,
        "text": "I'm Anna. I think the tools are most urgent. Our spades are broken, and there are only two watering cans for the whole garden.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9a52c10d5ba88554c2ce3a9216dc1fb99f246879406f3857872c78ff5673e445",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 308,
        "sourceEnd": 449,
        "text": "Some members want a shed to store the tools. It would cost 300 pounds. A water tank is another option. It could collect rainwater for summer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c545eb42e35b51386cb93020712c137d7e1b12f60fb4f55b1489770393260602",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 456,
        "sourceEnd": 481,
        "text": "How much would that cost?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d504f6ff3046df82fd366006b6fc2329e13dedf9fa7687c5773e09782df2cc0e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 489,
        "sourceEnd": 577,
        "text": "About 150 pounds. We also need seeds and plants; last year we spent 100 pounds on those.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "80d479caaedf56b976ed98d58f4c5605fb4c79ddaeffd6b29e19fe5ab705e284",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 584,
        "sourceEnd": 700,
        "text": "Then a shed and a tank would cost 450 pounds, leaving only 50 for seeds. That would be less than last year's amount.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9607108ff7da52d637c820f5e2e53b87585d4c50557a9d3db6af6926cc8f4a88",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 708,
        "sourceEnd": 832,
        "text": "Exactly. Before choosing, let's check last year's progress. We promised to grow vegetables for the food bank. What happened?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ea8be712944ae892b6be97731de10fbe9ee2846cfddff72ea3e1d00507f2c873",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 839,
        "sourceEnd": 988,
        "text": "We gave 20 kilograms of vegetables to the food bank. But we also promised to repair the fence. We didn't do that because we didn't have enough money.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9a67683b3b560a38ca9449638c17ce33deac0c67e24c98c3f160d90c934d6a3d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 996,
        "sourceEnd": 1047,
        "text": "So we should keep some money for repairs this time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "40247cf8b3afc19eb47fda117916d2da6596679dd27e13006a191070bef713dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 1054,
        "sourceEnd": 1171,
        "text": "Yes. A shed is a useful investment because dry tools should last longer, but buying it means delaying something else.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4cebbce7eb27a901d0b3f488f745601480d8c504b88aac8bf676413339a06704",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 1179,
        "sourceEnd": 1313,
        "text": "How about an agreed proposal: 300 pounds for a shed, 100 for seeds, and 100 for small repairs? We can ask members to donate old tools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f52f0e5cd675b98f5b0ddb3794bebfaa474b552ce7f8e81dd82eec74ce3e8c9d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 1320,
        "sourceEnd": 1414,
        "text": "That sounds reasonable. I still want the water tank, though. Are we ruling it out permanently?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6a92f1ad41b2a433461a0296fccf4952465ef15d5ae901254918ffe6d72a82f5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 1422,
        "sourceEnd": 1603,
        "text": "No. We can postpone buying it for now. Let's check again in six months. If we have saved enough money, we can buy it then. We aren't promising a purchase before we know the savings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1ad363ff9b11ec307cdffb94e755920fec1ccc7854969c606d10354db45f59ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 1610,
        "sourceEnd": 1747,
        "text": "I agree. So our proposal covers the shed, seeds and repairs, with donated tools if members can help. We'll review the tank in six months.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6cf6eaf0d05311ad6f61794d941242493e6b43d620bf1cc865e5fcbedd26cd69",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "david",
        "speaker": "David",
        "sourceStart": 1755,
        "sourceEnd": 1870,
        "text": "Correct. I'll put that proposal to the members for a vote. Their approval is still needed before we spend anything.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "52eca5c59ba47280ed51e81af0739ec120d1d2b8a5538eeb1701e310ef3450da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
